Well, it's there if you need it.

9
00:01:29,960 --> 00:01:32,060
真喜欢周六的早上，多么的宁静
Oh, I love Saturday mornings. So tranquil.

10
00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:35,660
仔细聆听，人能听到落叶的声音
You know, if you listen carefully, you can almost hear the leaves fall.

11
00:01:40,360 --> 00:01:41,380
好大一块落叶
Big leaves this year.

12
00:01:42,663 --> 00:01:43,930
你这臭蛋!
You scuzzball!

13
00:01:43,964 --> 00:01:45,265
你才是臭蛋!
You're the scuzzball!

14
00:01:45,299 --> 00:01:46,900
-去你妈的! -去你妈的!
- Your mama! - Your mama!

15
00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:50,840
等等，孩子们 你们有着同一个妈妈
Hey, wait, kids, kids, kids. You both have the same mama.

16
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:54,376
这是怎么了？
Come on, what's this all about?

17
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:56,080
凯罗把水龙头关掉了
Carol turned the water off!

18
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:59,000
我来淋浴，她把水龙头关掉了
I was taking a shower, and she turned the water off!

19
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,980
我是迫不得已，他不让我进去
I had to. He wouldn't let me in the bathroom.

20
00:02:02,140 --> 00:02:03,740
我不愿、意
I was indisposed.

21
00:02:05,820 --> 00:02:08,794
他进去1个半小时了
Well, he was in there for an hour and a half.

22
00:02:09,620 --> 00:02:12,120
1小时33分钟22秒
One hour, 33 minutes, and 22 seconds.

23
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:16,460
他想要破世界纪录
He's trying to get into the World Record Book.

24
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:18,940
什么记录？人肉泡菜？
As what, Ben? The Human Prune?

25
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:23,600
不，世上最长的淋浴
No, for taking the longest shower.

26
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:27,080
纪录只是374小时 我很容易就能打破
The record's only 374 hours. I can beat that, easy.

27
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:31,200
本，300小时，那是两个星期
Ben, 300, that's two weeks.

28
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,960
不能留在水里那么久
You can't stay in the water that long.

29
00:02:33,260 --> 00:02:35,300
人们也是这样对雅克说的
That's what they told Jacques Cousteau.

30
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:38,860
本，雅克有一艘潜艇
Ben, Jacques had a submarine.

31
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:40,480
他九岁时没有吧
Not when he was nine.

32
00:02:41,722 --> 00:02:43,058
本.
Ben....

33
00:02:43,591 --> 00:02:45,427
我想要永垂不朽.
Great. I wanted to be immortal.

34
