Instead, I'm just wet.

35
00:02:48,696 --> 00:02:49,997
永垂不朽？
Immortal?

36
00:02:50,820 --> 00:02:53,080
什么时候开始这样想的？
How long have you wanted to be immortal?

37
00:02:53,420 --> 00:02:54,480
自从两岁开始
Since I was two.

38
