Well, if you promise to stay out of the bathroom, maybe I'll help you.

39
00:03:01,909 --> 00:03:03,000
好吧
Okay.

40
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:07,240
不知道最长时间不洗澡的纪录是谁
Hey, I wonder what's the longest anyone's gone without a shower.

41
00:03:07,620 --> 00:03:09,600
那是上个暑假的麦克
I think it was Mike last summer.

42
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:15,000
刚才谈到宁静的周六早晨
Well, we we're talking about those tranquil Saturday mornings.

43
00:03:19,820 --> 00:03:22,140
看来他也进不了浴室
I guess he couldn't get in the bathroom, either.

44
00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:25,320
爸爸妈妈，我要学空手道
Hey, Mom, Dad, I want to take karate.

45
00:03:26,100 --> 00:03:28,220
我要破板，破砖
I want to split boards. I want to break bricks.

46
00:03:28,900 --> 00:03:30,120
快点去把我们家烟囱藏起来
Quick. Hide the chimney.

47
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:31,860
爸爸，我是认真的
Come on, Dad, I'm serious.

48
00:03:32,806 --> 00:03:34,608
今天开始第一堂课
And the first class starts today.

49
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:38,040
麦克，怎么突然热衷于空手道了？
Mike, why are you so hot, all of a sudden, about taking karate?

50
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:41,040
爸爸？ 妈妈竟然问为什么要学空手道
Can you believe that, Dad? She wants to know why I want to take karate.

51
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:43,320
-麦克 -什么？
- Mike? - Yeah, Dad?

52
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,580
为什么要学空手道？
Why do you want to take karate?

53
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:48,059
不知道，我就是想学
I don't know. I just want to.

54
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:49,960
很好的分析能力
The analytical mind at work.

55
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:52,120
做每件事情都需要理由的吗？
Come on, Dad. Does everybody have to have a reason for everything they do?

56
00:03:53,694 --> 00:03:55,740
-不是的 -那就对了
- No. - There you go, then.

57
00:03:55,740 --> 00:03:57,500
-那么你会给学费？ -不会
- So you'll pay for the lessons? - No.

58
00:03:58,520 --> 00:03:59,860
-为什么？ -不为什么
- Why not? - No reason.

59
