麦克，我和你爸都想问你.
Mike, I think I speak for both your father and myself when I ask you:

60
00:04:07,480 --> 00:04:09,460
空手道班上有女同学？
Is there a girl in this class?

61
00:04:10,744 --> 00:04:12,045
什么？
What?

62
00:04:13,614 --> 00:04:15,086
女同学？
A girl?

63
