我生气了
You know, I resent that.

64
00:04:18,440 --> 00:04:20,000
那就是“有”吧？
I take that as a "Yes."

65
00:04:21,340 --> 00:04:23,180
你们在说什么？
What are you guys talking about?

66
00:04:23,780 --> 00:04:26,720
记得你那次非得学骑马吗？
Remember when you just had to take horseback-riding lessons?

67
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:30,460
你说要克服对大型动物的恐惧
Yeah, cause you said it would help you overcome your fear of large animals?

68
00:04:32,460 --> 00:04:36,080
无可否认，黛比真的很巨大
Yeah, well, you gotta admit, Debbie DiZomba was large.

69
00:04:37,838 --> 00:04:42,143
是的，记得你非得要学 苏格兰民间舞蹈吗？
Right. And remember when you just had to learn Scottish folk dancing?

70
00:04:43,244 --> 00:04:45,376
我喜欢学习文化
Hey, I was starved for culture.

71
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:49,280
爸爸，这次是不同的 空手道是男人的运动
This is different, Dad. This is karate. It's a man's sport.

72
00:04:49,340 --> 00:04:52,080
-而且学费几乎为零 -很好
- And it costs next to nothing. - Oh, good, good.

73
00:04:52,586 --> 00:04:54,786
有1块钱散钱吗？
You got change for $1?

74
