只是125块
It's only $125, Dad.

76
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:03,260
而且还包括了几块训练用的砖头
And that includes a dozen training bricks.

77
00:05:06,033 --> 00:05:08,438
麦克，给你10块钱
Mike, heres $10.

78
