去买个汉堡包，更便宜
Go buy her a burger. It's cheaper.

79
00:05:15,740 --> 00:05:18,800
-给你倒了咖啡 -亲爱的，不能放这
- Brought you some coffee. - Hi, honey. Not there. No, no.

80
