How fun!

93
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:07,661
-测测我们怎么样 -测测我们怎么样
- Let's take it and see how we do. - Let's take it and see how we do.

94
00:06:07,661 --> 00:06:09,258
我知道我们会这么反应
I knew we would say that.

95
