我们之间没有冲突
We have no conflict.

104
00:06:35,320 --> 00:06:36,080
是吗？
Oh, yeah?

105
00:06:36,540 --> 00:06:38,480
-我要测试，你呢？ -我不要
- I want to take the test. Do you? - No.

106
