这些问题有深度，巧妙，有哲理
The questions are profound, astute, full of insight.

110
00:06:50,440 --> 00:06:52,460
特别是猥亵的那些
Especially the smutty ones.

111
00:06:54,620 --> 00:06:55,160
是啊，第12题
Yes, Number 12.

112
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:57,760
喜欢这个的话，看看33题
If you like that, wait till you get to Number 33.

113
00:06:59,760 --> 00:07:01,760
杰森，填一张试试
Oh, come on, Jason. Fill one out.

114
