邦纳，对，还记得那个空手道小子吗？
Yeah, Boner. Yeah, look, remember when we saw The Karate Kid?

121
00:07:20,860 --> 00:07:23,480
对，那老头对那小子说的.
Yeah. Okay. Well, what did the old man tell the kid...

122
