学空手道的最重要目的是什么？
was the most important reason to study karate?

123
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,880
不在，我出去买花生了
No, no, I was out getting the Goobers.

124
00:07:30,210 --> 00:07:31,238
对
Yeah.

125
00:07:32,146 --> 00:07:33,948
好，等等
Yeah, good. All right, wait.

126
00:07:36,860 --> 00:07:39,800
很好，邦纳，好得很
Good, Boner, good. Yeah, great.

127
00:07:41,380 --> 00:07:43,820
好的，谢谢，再见
Yeah, okay. All right, thanks a lot. Bye-bye.

128
00:07:47,580 --> 00:07:50,240
-爸爸，能聊两句吗？ -可以
- Dad. Hey, can we talk? - Sure.

129
