我也许反应过度了
this morning when you said I couldn't take the karate lessons.

131
00:07:58,360 --> 00:08:03,500
也许我以前曾经借上课来结识女孩子
And I know that, in the past, I may have used these activities to meet girls.

132
00:08:05,179 --> 00:08:08,840
但我真的希望你能让我 参加空手道学习班
But I'm really glad you put your foot down about these karate lessons, Dad...

133
