"because it develops discipline."

138
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:32,520
不单肉体上的纪律性 还包括心灵上的纪律性
Not only physical discipline, Dad, but spiritual discipline as well.

139
00:08:33,260 --> 00:08:34,600
这对你来说很重要
That's important to you, is it?

140
00:08:34,740 --> 00:08:35,980
是的
Oh, yeah, Dad.

141
00:08:37,077 --> 00:08:40,051
因为人若没有纪律性.
I mean, hey, with no discipline, each one of us...

142
00:08:40,060 --> 00:08:44,100
“就像在欲望的海洋失去船舵一样”
"is like a rudderless craft in a sea of conflicting desires."

143
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,280
还有.
And you know what, Dad?

144
00:08:50,380 --> 00:08:53,060
我需要空手道给予我的船舵
I need the rudder that karate will give me.

145
00:08:54,580 --> 00:08:55,380
我明白了
I see.

146
00:08:56,460 --> 00:08:58,280
你的意思是.
So what you're saying is that...

147
00:08:58,280 --> 00:09:03,480
学空手道会让你达到.
you're taking karate to help you achieve this spiritual state of...

148
